    "Rules card: lists the rules; each row shows an application and its input source. Right-click a row and choose 「Delete」 to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules card: lists the rules; each row shows an application and its input source. Right-click a row and choose 「Delete」 to remove it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则卡片：列出全部规则，每行显示应用及其输入源；右键点击某行并选择「删除」即可移除该规则。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則卡片：列出全部規則，每行顯示應用及其輸入源；右鍵點擊某行並選擇「刪除」即可移除該規則。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則卡片：列出全部規則，每行顯示應用及其輸入源；右鍵點擊某行並選擇「刪除」即可移除該規則。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則卡片：列出全部規則，每行顯示應用及其輸入源；右鍵點擊某行並選擇「刪除」即可移除該規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rules take effect only while the master switch is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules take effect only while the master switch is on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在总开关开启时规则才会生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在總開關開啟時規則才會生效。"
